# Curious Inquiry on Bot2's Ornithopter: the granted ability is the creature's own (CR 113.8), so when it deals combat damage to Bot1 on turn 4
# it is Bot2, the creature's controller, who investigates - not Bot1, the Aura's controller. Bot1 takes 1 (the +1/+1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Curious Inquiry
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Curious Inquiry.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Battlefield.Clue Token.Token = True
Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
